azO(){this.Nx("Privacy Policy","Chowy's Gadgets Privacy Policy\n\nLast updated: May 2026\n\n1. Information We Collect\nWe collect information you provide when creating an account, placing orders, or contacting support. This may include your name, email, phone number, and shipping address.\n\n2. How We Use Your Information\nYour information is used to process orders, deliver products, improve our services, and send notifications you have opted into.\n\n3. Data Security\nWe use industry-standard measures to protect your personal data. Payment details are handled securely and are not stored in plain text.\n\n4. Third-Party Services\nWe may share limited data with delivery partners and payment processors only as needed to complete your order.\n\n5. Your Rights\nYou may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting support@chowys-gadgets.com.\n\n6. Contact\nFor privacy questions, email support@chowys-gadgets.com.")},
azT(){this.Nx("Terms of Service","Chowy's Gadgets Terms of Service\n\nLast updated: May 2026\n\n1. Acceptance of Terms\nBy using this app, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please discontinue use.\n\n2. Orders & Payments\nAll orders are subject to availability and confirmation. Prices are listed in PHP unless stated otherwise. You agree to provide accurate payment and delivery information.\n\n3. Shipping & Delivery\nDelivery times are estimates and may vary. Risk of loss passes to you upon delivery to the address provided.\n\n4. Returns & Refunds\nDefective or incorrect items may be returned within 7 days of delivery. Contact support to initiate a return.\n\n5. Account Responsibility\nYou are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activity under your account.\n\n6. Limitation of Liability\nChowy's Gadgets is not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from use of the app or products purchased through it.\n\n7. Changes\nWe may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the app constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.\n\n8. Contact\nQuestions about these terms: support@chowys-gadgets.com.")},
